{"id":"7d33114b69","t":"I’ll Spend My Fortune to Become the Strongest Before the Game Ends","c":"cv","n":16,"l":24,"s":["mg"],"k":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends"},"u":1795852131620,"desc":"كان من حولي يسخرون مني ويصفونني بالأحمق، ظنًا منهم أنني فقدت عقلي بعدما أنفقت ثروتي بأكملها على لعبة أوشكت على الإغلاق. لكنني كنت الوحيد الذي يعرف الحقيقة: كانت هذه اللعبة على وشك أن تتحول إلى واقع. وبفضل مهاراتي في الاختراق، أعدت كتابة إحصائياتي وأزلت جميع القيود المفروضة عليها، وجعلتها لا نهائية. وعندما اندمجت اللعبة أخيرًا مع الواقع، أصبحت كيانًا لا يُقهر. اقرأ مانهوا I’ll Spend My Fortune to Become the Strongest Before the Game Ends مترجمة بالكامل بأعلى جودة على مانجا تايم (MangaTime). تابع أحدث الفصول الحصرية فور نزولها على موقعنا.","type":"مانجا","status":"مستمر","genres":["أكشن","إثارة","خيال علمي","دراما"],"src":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends"},"chapters":{"9":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"10":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"11":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"12":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"13":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"14":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"15":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"16":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"17":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"18":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"19":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"20":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"21":{"mg":"ill-spend-my-fortune-to-become-the-strongest-before-the-game-ends|"},"2